  "body": "I really like the threads feature. Unfortunately not all users use it consistently, so a channel has a mix of threaded and non-threaded messages. Some messages should be in a thread, others can stay singular.\r\n\r\nWould it be possible to extend the redact feature to move messages to a thread? And could it be possible for admins/mods not only the users themselves?\r\n",
